Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.16,0:07:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正剪纸_GBK\bord5\blur2\3c&H545354&\c&H9C9B9B&\pos(614,272)}压{*\c&H908F8F&}力{\c&H848383&}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.21,0:07:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正剪纸_GBK\bord5\blur2\3c&H545354&\c&H9C9B9B&\pos(614,372)}压{*\c&H908F8F&}力{\c&H848383&}
